**Seismograph** | Records earthquake waves
**Crescograph** | Plant growth (J.C. Bose)
**Kymograph** | Records muscle movement, pulse, blood pressure (graph)
**Polygraph** | Lie detector (pulse, BP, breathing, skin response)
**Sphygmomanometer** | Blood pressure
**Cardiograph / ECG** | Heart's electrical activity
**Audiometer** | Hearing ability
